<section id="out-of-office">
<title>Out of Office</title>
<p>Define the email reply to automatically send to internal or external persons in a certain time period.</p>
</section>

<section id="delegates">
<title>Delegates</title>
<p>Define who can send emails and reply to meeting requests on your behalf.</p>
</section>

